sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Approver
    participant API as Invoice API
    participant DB as Database + outbox
    participant Worker as Submission worker
    participant PayEx as External PayEx API

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Approver->>API: Approve invoice
        API->>DB: Begin transaction
        API->>DB: Save decision + audit + outbox item
        DB-->>API: Commit successful
        API-->>Approver: Approval recorded
    end

    rect rgb(254, 243, 199)
        Worker->>DB: Read pending outbox item
        DB-->>Worker: Submission details + stable key
        Worker->>PayEx: Submit invoice with idempotency key
        PayEx-->>Worker: Result or provider reference

        alt Confirmed success
            Worker->>DB: Persist provider reference and completed status
        else Confirmed failure
            Worker->>DB: Record failure and retry policy state
        else Timeout / ambiguous result
            Worker->>DB: Record outcome as unknown
            Note over Worker,PayEx: Retry with the same key if supported
            Note over Worker,PayEx: Otherwise reconcile before resubmission
        end
    end

    Note over Approver,PayEx: PROPOSED DESIGN — NOT IMPLEMENTED
    Note over DB,Worker: Durable outbox enables at-least-once delivery, not automatic exactly-once effects

    %% Proposed flow only; this sequence is not implemented in the current application.
